From: Apex Radiance
Subject: [PATCH 0004] d3d9: ID3D9VkExternalPass records a caller's Vulkan commands in the command stream

A new interop interface (own IID, so stock DXVK answers E_NOINTERFACE). ExecuteExternal copies the caller's data and,
on the command stream thread in stream order, releases each Direct3D 9 resource to the given layout, starts external
rendering (DXVK re-binds all of its state afterwards), calls the callback with the execution command buffer and takes
the resources back. SupportsRayQuery says whether patch 0003 enabled acceleration structures and ray queries.
DxvkCommandList gets a public accessor for the execution command buffer.
---
